# --- Logs ---
*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# --- Alembic (keep migrations, ignore local db) ---
*.sqlite3

# --- Celery beat's local schedule store (runtime state, not source —
# regenerated every time `celery beat` runs locally) ---
celerybeat-schedule*
